@startuml
title Weather Monitoring System - User Authentication and Location Selection

[*] --> Login
state Login <<choice>>
Login --> Successful_Login : [successful login]
Login --> Registration : [new user]

Successful_Login --> Check_Location : [check current location or enter another]
Check_Location --> Valid_Location : [valid location entered]
Valid_Location --> Weather_Info : [select weather information to check]
Weather_Info --> Additional_Details : [view additional details]
ReadFeedbackChoice --> Logout : [log out after completing task]

Registration --> Registration_Success : [successful registration]
Registration --> Invalid_Details : [invalid user details]
Invalid_Details --> End_Process : [end process]
Registration_Success --> Save_User_Info : [save user's information]
Save_User_Info --> Login : [allow login after successful registration]

Invalid_Location --> End_Process : [end process if new location entered is not valid]
@enduml
